            </note>
            <note corresp="#d566-f3" n="59" xml:id="d566-f3-content">
                <p>Signed March 10, 1934; for text, see <hi rendition="#italic">Le Moniteur, Journal
                        Officiel de la République d’Haiti</hi>, April 23, 1934, p. 255. The <hi
                        rendition="#italic">avenant</hi> extended the Franco-Haitian commercial
                    convention of April 12, 1930.</p>
            </note>
